{
  "name": "clay",
  "label": "Clay",
  "description": "Playdough and claymation. Everything is a soft matte lump of modelling clay in Play-Doh colors: blue, red, yellow, green and purple on warm putty, or dark plasticine after dark. Surfaces carry a lit clay grain and the odd fingerprint; shapes are lumpy and hand-rolled; keys squish when you press them; fields and switches are pressed into the clay; the featured card is a yellow slab on a red one; progress is a rolled clay snake, steps are beads and the spinner is four balls bouncing with squash and stretch.",
  "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap",
